# Completion and signature help

groceries := table
| item  | quantity | price |
| ----- | -------- | ----- |
| apple | 2        | $3.30 |

total := sum(groceries, quantity * price)
focus := countdown(25m)

- [ ] Prep @timer(focus) @due(tomorrow)

<!-- Try: type [ in prose to complete names; inside sum(groceries, ...) column
names are offered; after @timer( only timers; after @due( only dates. Inside
countdown( signature help describes each argument. Type focus. for properties.
On an itinerary line, a time then two spaces offers stop kinds. -->
